hey what's up guys and welcome to  something a little different as you can  probably tell this is dark souls modded  and it's going to be the first in a  three-part series where i'm going to mod  the game in some of my favorite ways and  basically showcase it to you so it's  pretty obvious what i've modded in this  video we're playing in first person and  you're watching me fight through the  first stage in order to reach the taurus  demon and playing like this was actually  a lot of fun obviously it's not perfect  there are some camera bugs but it's  definitely functional as you'll see i  don't have too much trouble making my  way through the stage one of the best  things i've actually done is pick up  this spear and this was a good choice  for a few reasons one it's highly  visible in first person and two rolling  actually messes with the camera so you  tend to use your shield a lot and in any  situation where you use your shield the  spear is just naturally a good choice  so what's it like playing in first  person well you'll get some idea as you  watch these gameplay clips but if i had  to describe it to someone else basically  it's like skyrim but with gameplay the  combat works surprisingly well but i'd  only really recommend it to an  experienced player who knows weapon move  sets enemy patterns and someone who has  a really good grasp of the controls and  the reason i say this is that it's not  perfect the camera has trouble adjusting  sometimes and if you know exactly how to  move your character in the game then  you'll have a much better time but  generally this works well enough that i  reckon you could do a really good play  through with it i really like it  the most important thing by far is that  it actually puts you in the shoes of  your character so dark souls is a tense  game but when you're actually looking  around from a first person perspective  it becomes that bit more tense for  example there's something more fun about  turning around and seeing an enemy right  in your sights with his sword raised or  when you see an arrow flying towards  your character playing with this limited  view just means that you're more  surprised by things and it makes the  action a bit more visceral i guess you  feel as though you're playing as the  character much more and i guess playing  as the character extends to all first  person games i mean this affects more  than just the combat dark souls is a  game where you really experience the  world around you and i think that  meeting npcs and experiencing the world  around you fits so well with a souls  game and i definitely wouldn't mind from  developing a first person rpg similar to  this remember that some of the first  games from maid were kingsfield games  and those were in first person imagine a  modern day king's field with souls  gameplay and that would be so good  so many people will have clicked this  video intending to figure out exactly  how i made my game in first person but  unfortunately the person who taught me  doesn't want this information available  to the public the program i'm using can  be used for many more malicious things  and i don't really want to be  responsible for the pc version  decreasing in quality at the same time i  also think some of you deserve to know  having the ability to mod the game in  this way opens up so much creative  potential it's the reason my recent  videos have such great footage i can  move the camera around i can make people  invisible i can summon other people into  my world without being white phantoms  all of this is great and there are some  of you out there who would be able to  make some really good content with these  tools however there are also people out  there who would invade other people's  worlds and mess with their games so  maybe it's for the best if i keep this  information to myself even if a big part  of me thinks that it's not a big deal if  everyone knows let me know what you  think i'm really torn on this issue  anyway i mentioned before that my recent  videos have increased in quality i was  looking at my older videos the other day  and i don't know why they got so many  views my microphone was terrible my  narration was really melodramatic and i  didn't have nearly the same amount of  skill in gathering footage  i'm speaking mostly about my first few  prepare to cry videos with the prepare  to cry series i focused on the best  stories first like artorias sigma the  sisters of chaos those were the three  most emotional stories in the game so  naturally i did them first the problem  with that is that now that my video  quality has improved the three best  stories were done when i just wasn't  really experienced so i think i'll redo  those videos i won't delete them but  i'll remake them with new footage better  narration and just better overall  quality would you guys like that let me  know  so that pretty much does it for this  video the rest of the video is just me  trying to take out the tourist demon if  you want to see how that ends feel free  to stick around  but um if you haven't subscribed already  feel free to subscribe the next few  videos i'm going to be putting out are  also mod videos showcasing two more mods  that i actually think are better than  this mod if you can believe it  so as usual guys thanks for watching and  i'll see you guys next time  you
 

